    rho_DE = (d+1)/2 * m_nu^4        [residual]
           * (1 + c * delta)          [EFT soft projector]
           * 1                        [timelike projection]

Proof of Theorem 1.
Composing the three factors:

    rho_DE = (d+1)/2 * m_nu^4 * (1 + c * delta)

